  "title": "Kurt Sievers, Retired CEO of NXP Semiconductors, Appointed to Booking Holdings Board of Directors",
  "summary": "Booking Holdings Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG) announced that its Board of Directors has appointed Kurt Sievers, former Chief Executive Officer of NXP Semiconductors, to the Board effective today. Mr. Sievers served as President and Chief Executive Officer of NXP Semiconductors N.V. from 2020 until his retirement in 2025. He previously served as President beginning in 2018 and joined NXP's Executive Management Team in 2009. During his tenure, he helped shape the company's long–term strategy and led major",
